while, John gets his first look at the pirates-- and gets caught by them, along with Curly and Slightly. On the ship, Captain Hook appears for the first time and puts John up on a plank high above the water. Before he gets to laugh, Peter appears. Unable to fly away, with his friends held hostage and Hook coming at him with a sword, there seems to be no chance for Peter to get away alive. But fortunately for him, this episode also includes the first appearance of the ticking crocodile.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/106121/909521.jpg"},{"title":"Smee`s Sewing Machine","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2294","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1638","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1638","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"14578","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"106121","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"92396","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/106121/909531.jpg"},{"title":"John the Pirate","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2294","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1638","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1638","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"14578","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"106121","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"92397","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/106121/909541.jpg"},{"title":"The Neverbird Egg","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2294","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1638","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1638","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"145